# RAKSHIO uses NO environment variables and NO secret keys.
#
# The app is a fully static, zero-backend PWA: it starts with no .env file
# at all. Nothing in this file is read by the app — the only `import.meta.env`
# reference in the code is Vite's built-in PROD flag (set by the build
# itself, not by any .env value).
#
# The placeholder below exists only to show the format. Do NOT put real
# values or real secrets in this file — there is nothing to configure.
#
# Example placeholder (NOT read by the app):
# VITE_EXAMPLE_PLACEHOLDER=your-value-here
